                                "sense_id": "52cd2a79-c10d-33e9-b866-bd658b7d9b72",
                                "text": "It is a common observation that garbages are scattered around the slums. The respondents complained that the municipal sweepers seldom bother to collect the accumulated garbages from around the slums."
